# picker-keys (M8): the picker from the keyboard (SegmentedControl.tsx, radioKeys.ts). Three plain
# Tabs reach the picked option, x², as Chromium tabs (call 3 f; WebKit's first): its ring. → chooses
# x³ at once (P (2, 8) above the view: its edge marker, the ▲ in its row), End sin x, → wraps to x;
# the ring follows the choice. Each shot catches the function switch a frame in (FV 05: the old
# curve fading over 160 ms, the new one drawing on over 900 ms; M10 made the port's), then the
# switch runs its course before the next key; the last choice is shot at rest too.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
tab
tab
wait 16
shot focused
key ArrowRight
wait 16
shot x3
wait 1484
key End
wait 16
shot sin
wait 1484
key ArrowRight
wait 16
shot wrapped
wait 1484
shot wrapped-rest
